# Dependencies and build output are reproducible from package.json + the lockfile.
node_modules/
dist/

# Screenshots. These are regenerable output, not source — `npm run capture` rebuilds the whole
# set, and `npm run shot` takes a single frame. They were tracked for a while and it cost 736 MB
# of history for 30 commits: PNGs do not delta-compress, so every re-capture of a 4 MB image is
# another 4 MB in the pack forever. Stripped, the same history is 31 MB.
docs/captures/

